  "idea": "Baserow: the completely free open-source Airtable alternative",
  "text": "This free spreadsheet-database hybrid completely replaces expensive no-code tools. Project leads waste hours manually consolidating status updates because their database restricts team access behind expensive user licenses. Restricting collaborator access creates communication silos and causes missed deadlines on high-priority client deliverables. Baserow provides unlimited team members, customizable role permissions, and instant webhook notifications completely free. Your entire company collaborates on unified data without seat fees.",
